rooms_desc ({"You're standing in the doorway of Hypno's house. You noticea weak red glow from the south.","The whole room is painted in shimmering black. On one of thewalls you notice a red-glowing sign of anarchy. The floor iscovered with a clear deep black layer which allows you to seeyour own image like in a mirror. Hanging down from the ceilingthere's a large pyramid-shaped dark-red lamp which illuminatesthe room in a weak red which is reflected by the walls and thefloor. To the south there's a door to the second hallway ofthe house.","Now you have entered the second hallway of this quitemystic appearing house. You notice that now blue is thedominating colour of the room and you also notice the largeblue-glowing pentagram which covers nearly the whole ceiling.The black walls and the floor which reflects the soft glowof the pentagram look quite similar to the first hallway'ssimple but impressive decoration. The only source of lighthere is the ceiling pentagram emitting a tranquilizingblue.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,})
